  "description": "Experience the charm of true British craftsmanship and venture anywhere with ease on the Pashley Pathfinder E.\nThis is a bicycle which combines Pashley’s classic hand-crafted tradition with the very best in modern engineering and electric bicycle technology.\nBuilt in Britain by our master craftsmen from the highest quality trusted Reynolds steel and 3D printed Stainless Steel frame parts, the Pathfinder-E is lightweight, nimble and comfortable, so you can effortlessly explore with the added benefit of a powerful, quiet, reliable and subtly-integrated electric-assisted drive to aid pedalling and help you go further and climb hills with ease.\nFully equipped weighing only 17.8kg and powered by the discreet Mahle X30 rear drive motor with seamlessly integrated internal battery. Enjoy a smooth, effortless ride through town or country, with all the style, grace and comfort for which Pashley is renowned.",
